<title>USA: EMC names Colin Patteson chief admin officer.</title>
<headline>EMC names Colin Patteson chief admin officer.</headline>
<dateline>HOPKINTON, Mass. 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>EMC Corp said on Friday it promoted Colin Patteson to senior vice president and chief administrative officer.</p>
<p>Patteson's previous titles were vice president and chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Also promoted was another vice president, William Teuber Jr, who was named chief financial officer. Previously he had been corporate controller.</p>
